# Jumping to a label inside a foreachdir block enters with that directional
# memory context selected.  The game compiles labels within the loop graph;
# treating the jump as a flat source-line transfer leaves mem1 unset.
name Jump Into Foreach
dim 5 5
commands jump foreachdir pickup
ent worker 1 2
ent cube 2 2 7
goal all_cubes_held
